<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Oct supermarket sales up to $788 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentine Oct supermarket sales up to $788 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Supermarket sales in Argentina rose to $788 million in October from $742 million in September, the Economy Ministry said Thursday.</p>
<p>It also estimated November sales at $834 million and December's, due to seasonal sales and the opening of new stores, at more than $900 million.</p>
<p>Sales per square meter rose to $1,071 in October from 1,051 in September. The ministry estimated November's sales per square meter at $1,105.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0652</p>
</text>
